#: KPrConfig.cpp:702
msgid "Direct insert cursor"
msgstr ""

#: KPrConfig.cpp:704
msgid ""
"When this box is checked then you can select a section of text using your "
"mouse. Move the mouse to a new place in your document and click once with the "
"middle mouse button and a copy of the selected text is copied and pasted to the "
"new location in the document.\n"
"When there is no mark in this checkbox, in order to copy text from one section "
"to another, you must select the text, manually copy the text in to the "
"clipboard, then manually paste the text in the new location."
msgstr ""

